// Hand-built brand icons for /gears tools with no entry in the installed
// react-icons/si (Simple Icons) set — verified absent as of react-icons 5.7.0
// and the simple-icons snapshot behind react-icons v6 beta.
//
// Sources (official/verified brand marks, not generic placeholders):
// - VS Code, PowerShell: Tabler Icons "brand" set (tabler:brand-vscode, tabler:brand-powershell)
// - Windows Terminal, Requestly: selfh.st icons, monochrome "-dark" variant
// - Antigravity: Boxicons logos (bxl:google-antigravity)
// - Devin: Cognition's own site icon (cognition.ai/icon.svg) — Devin is
//   Cognition's flagship/only product, so their brand mark stands for it
// - Wispr Flow: the standalone icon mark isolated from Wispr Flow's own
//   logo lockup SVG (homarr-labs/dashboard-icons), wordmark paths dropped
// - Trae: LobeHub's curated icon set (@lobehub/icons-static-svg), monochrome variant
// - Comet: perplexity.ai itself sits behind a Cloudflare bot challenge, but
//   the Wayback Machine has an archived snapshot of the perplexity.ai/comet
//   landing page (Framer-hosted) with its real favicon — a 32x32 PNG, the
//   only official Comet mark found anywhere. Embedded as a data URI since
//   no vector exists; this is the one raster icon in the set.
// - WebStorm, PyCharm: JetBrains' own brand CDN
//   (resources.jetbrains.com/storage/products/company/brand/logos/), which
//   serves their current (2023 rebrand) icons — dark square, gradient
//   corner, white glyph. These replace the older flat-color Simple Icons
//   versions (SiWebstorm/SiPycharm), which are the pre-rebrand design.
// - Qoder: qoder.com's own favicon (SVG, served from their CDN)
// Fetched via the Iconify API (api.iconify.design), official sites,
// homarr-labs/dashboard-icons, @lobehub/icons-static-svg, and web.archive.org,
// then inlined as JSX.

